    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br>SPIN UP is a climbing action game set on a planet.<br>After falling to an unknown planet, players aim for the top in order to return to their friends.<br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>The game is controlled with the left and right keys, and the player climbs by &quot;grabbing&quot; and &quot;spinning&quot;.<br><br>Pressing the key allows the player to grab onto any object,<br>While grabbing an object, the player rotates while accelerating.<br>The moment you release the key, it will fly away by the rotational force.<br><br>Where it flies depends on the rotation force and the timing of releasing the key.<br><br>Don't give up.<br>We are waiting for you at the top!<br><br><br><strong>About video distribution</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Both individuals and corporations can distribute their videos.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Monetization is only possible when using the functions provided by the video sharing site.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Story</strong><br>SPIN UP is a climbing action game set on a planet.<br>After falling to an unknown planet, players aim for the top in order to return to their friends.<br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>The game is controlled with the left and right keys, and the player climbs by &quot;grabbing&quot; and &quot;spinning&quot;.<br><br>Pressing the key allows the player to grab onto any object,<br>While grabbing an object, the player rotates while accelerating.<br>The moment you release the key, it will fly away by the rotational force.<br><br>Where it flies depends on the rotation force and the timing of releasing the key.<br><br>Don't give up.<br>We are waiting for you at the top!<br><br><br><strong>About video distribution</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Both individuals and corporations can distribute their videos.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Monetization is only possible when using the functions provided by the video sharing site.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a climbing action game. The goal is to reach the top by &quot;grabbing&quot; and &quot;spinning.&quot;",
